# Company Contacts — Frontend Reference & Postman Test Guide

---

## 🔗 API Endpoints

| # | Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|--------|----------|-------------|
| 1 | **POST** | `/api/college/add_company_contact/:companyId` | Add contact person to company |
| 2 | **GET** | `/api/college/get_company_contacts/:companyId` | List contacts for a company |
| 3 | **PUT** | `/api/college/update_contact/:contactId` | Update contact info |
| 4 | **PATCH** | `/api/college/toggle_contact_status/:contactId` | Activate / Deactivate contact |

> **Auth**: JWT cookie from college admin / TPO login required.

---

## 📝 API 1: Add Contact

**`POST /api/college/add_company_contact/:companyId`**

### Request Body
```json
{
  "contact_name": "Priya Sharma",
  "contact_designation": "HR Manager",
  "contact_email": "priya.sharma@tcs.com",
  "contact_phone": "9876543210",
  "is_primary": true,
  "notes": "Primary campus hiring contact for 2026 batch"
}
```

### Fields

| Field | Type | Required | UI Element | Validation |
|-------|------|----------|------------|------------|
| `contact_name` | string | ✅ Yes | **Single-line Input** | Min 2, Max 200 chars |
| `contact_designation` | string | ❌ No | **Single-line Input** | Max 150 chars |
| `contact_email` | string | ❌ No | **Single-line Input** (email) | Valid email format |
| `contact_phone` | string | ❌ No | **Single-line Input** (tel) | 10-15 digits only |
| `is_primary` | boolean | ❌ No | **Toggle Switch** | Default: false |
| `notes` | string | ❌ No | **Textarea** (2-3 rows) | Max 1000 chars |

> **⚡ Primary Contact Logic**: When `is_primary = true`, the API **auto-demotes** any existing primary contact for that company. Only 1 primary contact per company at a time.

### Success Response (201)
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Contact person added successfully",
  "data": {
    "contact_id": "cnt-1234-...",
    "company_id": "cmp-5678-...",
    "company_name": "Tata Consultancy Services",
    "contact_name": "Priya Sharma",
    "contact_designation": "HR Manager",
    "contact_email": "priya.sharma@tcs.com",
    "contact_phone": "9876543210",
    "is_primary": true,
    "is_active": true,
    "notes": "Primary campus hiring contact for 2026 batch",
    "created_at": "2026-03-02T15:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

---

## 📝 API 2: List Company Contacts

**`GET /api/college/get_company_contacts/:companyId`**

### Query Parameters
| Param | Type | Required | Notes |
|-------|------|----------|-------|
| `is_active` | boolean | ❌ | Filter active/inactive contacts |
| `search` | string | ❌ | Search by name, email, or designation |

### Response (200)
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Company contacts retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "company": {
      "company_id": "cmp-5678-...",
      "company_name": "Tata Consultancy Services"
    },
    "total_contacts": 3,
    "active_contacts": 2,
    "contacts": [
      {
        "contact_id": "cnt-1234-...",
        "contact_name": "Priya Sharma",
        "contact_designation": "HR Manager",
        "contact_email": "priya.sharma@tcs.com",
        "contact_phone": "9876543210",
        "is_primary": true,
        "is_active": true,
        "notes": "Primary campus hiring contact"
      },
      {
        "contact_id": "cnt-5678-...",
        "contact_name": "Amit Kumar",
        "contact_designation": "Technical Lead",
        "is_primary": false,
        "is_active": true,
        "notes": null
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

---

## 📝 API 3: Update Contact

**`PUT /api/college/update_contact/:contactId`** — At least 1 field required.

```json
{
  "contact_designation": "Senior HR Manager",
  "contact_phone": "9876543211"
}
```
Same fields as create, all optional. If `is_primary = true`, auto-demotes other primary contacts.

---

## 📝 API 4: Toggle Contact Status

**`PATCH /api/college/toggle_contact_status/:contactId`**

```json
{ "is_active": false }
```

---

## 🔄 Integration with Company Management

```
Company Detail Page (/api/college/get_company/:companyId)
    │
    ├── Company Info Section (from company APIs)
    │
    ├── 📋 Contacts Tab ← YOU ARE HERE
    │   ├── "Add Contact" button → opens modal
    │   ├── Contacts table (sorted: primary first)
    │   │   └── Each row: Name, Designation, Email, Phone, Primary badge, Status, Actions
    │   └── Actions: Edit, Toggle Status
    │
    └── 💼 Jobs Tab (future — job postings by this company)
```

### Data Lifecycle
1. **Company created** → no contacts initially
2. **Admin adds contacts** → first contact auto-suggested as primary
3. **Job posting created** → references `company_id` (contacts shown for reference)
4. **Contact deactivated** → hidden from active list but preserved for history
5. **Primary changed** → old primary auto-demoted, new one promoted

