### Test 1: Add Primary Contact
```
POST /api/college/add_company_contact/<companyId>
```
```json
{
  "contact_name": "Priya Sharma",
  "contact_designation": "HR Manager",
  "contact_email": "priya.sharma@tcs.com",
  "contact_phone": "9876543210",
