```
GET /api/college/get_company_contacts/<companyId>
```

### Test 6: List Active Only
```
GET /api/college/get_company_contacts/<companyId>?is_active=true
```

### Test 7: Search Contacts
```
GET /api/college/get_company_contacts/<companyId>?search=priya
```

### Test 8: Update Contact
```
PUT /api/college/update_contact/<contactId>
```
```json
{
  "contact_designation": "Senior HR Manager",
  "contact_phone": "9876543211",
  "notes": "Updated: Promoted to Senior HR Manager"
}
```

### Test 9: Promote to Primary via Update
```json
{
  "is_primary": true
}
```

### Test 10: Deactivate Contact
```
PATCH /api/college/toggle_contact_status/<contactId>
```
```json
{ "is_active": false }
```

### Test 11: Reactivate Contact
```json
{ "is_active": true }
```

### Test 12: Same Status Toggle (expect 400)
Send `{ "is_active": true }` when already active → `400 Bad Request`

### Test 13: Invalid Company (expect 404)
```
POST /api/college/add_company_contact/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
```
```json
{ "contact_name": "Test Contact" }
```

### Test 14: Invalid Contact (expect 404)
```
PUT /api/college/update_contact/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
```
```json
{ "contact_name": "Test" }
```

