## 🎨 Frontend UI Recommendations

### Contacts Section (inside Company Detail Page)
- Show as a **tab** or **section** below company info
- **"Add Contact" button** → opens modal/drawer
- **Table**: Name, Designation, Email, Phone, Primary (⭐ badge), Status, Actions
- **Primary contact** highlighted with a star icon
- **Actions**: Edit (pencil icon), Toggle Status (switch)

### Add/Edit Contact Modal
| # | Field | UI Element | Notes |
|---|-------|------------|-------|
| 1 | Name | **Single-line input** | Required, autofocus |
| 2 | Designation | **Single-line input** | Optional, placeholder: "e.g. HR Manager" |
| 3 | Email | **Single-line input** (email) | Optional, email validation |
| 4 | Phone | **Single-line input** (tel) | Optional, 10-15 digits |
| 5 | Primary Contact | **Toggle/Checkbox** | Show warning: "This will replace existing primary" |
| 6 | Notes | **Textarea** (2-3 rows) | Optional, max 1000 chars |

### Frontend Validation

| Field | Rule |
|-------|------|
| `contact_name` | Required, min 2 chars, max 200 chars |
| `contact_designation` | Optional, max 150 chars |
| `contact_email` | Optional, valid email if provided |
| `contact_phone` | Optional, digits only, 10-15 chars |
| `notes` | Optional, max 1000 chars |
